# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in from your Supabase project's
# Settings → API page. The anon key is safe to embed client-side by
# Supabase's own design — Row Level Security is what actually protects the
# data, not keeping this key secret.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
